---
import BaseHead from "../../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE, WALINE_SERVER_URL } from "../../consts";

const title = `Privacy Policy - ${SITE_TITLE}`;
const description = "How lazynoman handles your data.";
const lastUpdated = "June 2, 2026";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={title} description={description} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<article class="prose-custom">
				<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-2">
					Privacy Policy
				</h1>
				<p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-10">
					Last updated: {lastUpdated}
				</p>

				<section
					class="space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-[17px] md:text-[18px]"
				>
					<p>
						This Privacy Policy explains how lazynoman
						(&ldquo;I,&rdquo; &ldquo;me,&rdquo; &ldquo;my&rdquo;)
						collects, uses, and protects information when you visit <strong
							>lazynoman.com</strong
						>. I take your privacy seriously and aim to be fully
						transparent about what data is processed on this site.
					</p>

					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">
						1. Information I Collect
					</h2>

					<h3 class="font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">
						a. Analytics (Google Tag Manager)
					</h3>
					<p>
						This site uses Google Tag Manager (GTM-WC6RL4N6) to load
						Google Analytics. These services use cookies and similar
						technologies to collect anonymized usage data,
						including:
					</p>
					<ul
						class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-muted-foreground"
					>
						<li>Pages visited and time spent on each page</li>
						<li>Browser type, device type, and operating system</li>
						<li>
							General geographic location (country/city level, not
							precise coordinates)
						</li>
						<li>Referral source (how you arrived at the site)</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						This data is aggregated and anonymized. I use it solely
						to understand which content resonates with readers and
						to improve the site. Google&rsquo;s use of this data is
						governed by their own privacy policy. You can opt out of
						Google Analytics by installing the
						<a
							href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline"
						>
							Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a
						>.
					</p>

					<h3 class="font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">
						b. Comments (Waline)
					</h3>
					<p>
						This site uses Waline, a self-hosted comment system
						running on Vercel at
						<code class="bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm"
							>{WALINE_SERVER_URL}</code
						>. When you leave a comment, you may provide:
					</p>
					<ul
						class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-muted-foreground"
					>
						<li>A display name (required to post)</li>
						<li>
							An email address (optional; used for Gravatar
							avatars and notification replies)
						</li>
						<li>
							A website URL (optional; displayed with your
							comment)
						</li>
						<li>The content of your comment</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						Your email is stored securely and is never shared
						publicly, sold, or used for marketing. It is only used
						to fetch your Gravatar profile picture (if available)
						and to notify you of replies if you opt in. Comment data
						is stored on the Waline server and is only accessible to
						me as the site owner.
					</p>

					<h3 class="font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">c. Cloudflare</h3>
					<p>
						This site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may
						process standard web server logs (IP address, request
						timestamps, pages requested) as part of its content
						delivery and security services. This data is handled in
						accordance with
						<a
							href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline"
							>Cloudflare&rsquo;s Privacy Policy</a
						>.
					</p>

					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">
						2. How I Use Your Information
					</h2>
					<p>
						I use the collected information for the following
						purposes:
					</p>
					<ul
						class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-muted-foreground"
					>
						<li>
							To understand reading patterns and improve content
						</li>
						<li>To enable and manage comments on posts</li>
						<li>To maintain site security and availability</li>
						<li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						I do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or share your personal
						information with third parties for their marketing purposes.
					</p>

					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">3. Cookies</h2>
					<p>
						This site uses minimal cookies. Google Analytics sets
						cookies to distinguish unique visitors and track session
						information. Waline may set a session cookie for comment
						functionality. You can control cookie preferences
						through your browser settings.
					</p>

					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">
						4. Data Retention
					</h2>
					<p>
						Comment data is retained indefinitely so that comment
						threads remain intact. If you want a comment removed,
						contact me and I will honor the request. Analytics data
						is retained per Google&rsquo;s data retention policies
						(currently 26 months).
					</p>

					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">5. Your Rights</h2>
					<p>
						Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right
						to:
					</p>
					<ul
						class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-muted-foreground"
					>
						<li>
							Request access to personal data I hold about you
						</li>
						<li>Request deletion of your comment data</li>
						<li>
							Opt out of analytics tracking (via browser add-on or
							Do Not Track headers)
						</li>
						<li>
							Withdraw consent where processing is based on
							consent
						</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						To exercise any of these rights, reach out via the
						contact methods below. I will respond within 30 days.
					</p>

					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">
						6. Third-Party Links
					</h2>
					<p>
						This site contains links to external websites (including
						novel platforms, GitHub, and Discord). I am not
						responsible for the privacy practices of these
						third-party sites. Please review their privacy policies
						independently.
					</p>

					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">
						7. Changes to This Policy
					</h2>
					<p>
						I may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.
						Changes will be posted on this page with an updated
						&ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date. Continued use of the
						site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated
						policy.
					</p>

					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">8. Contact</h2>
					<p>
						If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding
						this Privacy Policy, you can reach me through:
					</p>
					<ul
						class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-muted-foreground"
					>
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://github.com/rockyxwall"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener noreferrer"
								class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline"
								>GitHub: rockyxwall</a>
						</li>
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://discord.gg/cunXbtHm5g"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener noreferrer"
								class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline"
								>Discord</a>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</section>
			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
